.Xr mpshuffle 1 ,
.Xr vimp 1
.Sh HISTORY
.Xr mploop 1
was created in September to November 2023. It has been maintained since.
.Sh DISTRIBUTION
.Xr mploop 1
is available at https://github.com/jmtilli/mploop
.Sh BUGS
.Bl -bullet
.It
.Nm mploop
misbehaves if the song names have newlines in them. Spaces are supported, but
newlines are not.
.It
.Nm mploop
does not support gapless playback.
.El
.Pp
Also, some utilities like
.Xr mpseek 1
and
.Xr mprewind 1
have bugs.
